  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: (28 ÷ 4) - (15 × 3) + 48 = ?\n\nAfter '+' and ‘-' are interchanged and '×' and ‘÷' are interchanged then,\n\n(28 ÷ 4) - (15 × 3) + 48 = ? ⇒ (28 × 4) + (15 ÷ 3) - 48 = ?\n\n⇒ (28 × 4) + __**(15 ÷ 3)**__ - 48 = ?\n\n⇒ __**(28 × 4)**__ + 5 - 48 = ?\n\n⇒ __**112 + 5**__ - 48 = ?\n\n⇒ __117____** - 48**__ = ?\n\n⇒ **69 = ?**\n\nHence, \"Option 3\" is the correct answer.",
